{"entry":{"record":{"cwd":"C:\\Users\\Yufeng Ying\\Desktop\\Ring-lang","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"main","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"text":"明白,不偷懒,上真东西。这个决定对——never-drop+intern 本质是\"用不释放绕过 UAF\",measurement 已经证明它达不了 G-a。\n\n## 把根因摆正\n\n当初 A1 `never-drop` 不是内存方案,是**给 Type-DAG 的 UAF 打的麻药**。真正的病是 **Type 的 RC 不健全**:\n\n- `ring_dup` 浅(只 +1 最外层) vs `drop_T` 深递归(drop type_params/fields/variants)\n- `apply_subst` 共享子结构(`fields: fields` / `variants: variants` 直接透传)**却不 dup**\n- → 某个 Type 被 drop 时深递归 free 了别的 parent 仍引用的共享子结构 → over-free(UAF)\n\nA1 用\"谁都不 drop\"把这个 UAF 摁住了,代价是**全员泄漏**。**完整的内存回收 = 把这个 RC 修对,让 Type 能安全 drop、正常回收**——这才是 Perceus 该干的事,Type 当初被错误地特例排除在 Perceus 之外了。\n\n## 机制方向\n\n| 方案 | 实质 | 评价 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **(R) 把 Type 正确纳入 Perceus RC** | 修 dup/drop 对称性 + 每处共享 dup 子结构 → drop 在 rc==0 时安全深 free → scope 结束正常回收 | 〔推荐〕Perceus-native、根因修复、回收**所有**类型(不止能 intern 的)、与编译器其余部分一致 |\n| (E) inference-transient region/arena | 推断期临时 Type 进 arena,阶段边界批量释放 | 可作 R 的优化补充,但单独用要解逃逸(=escape 分析),复杂 |\n| (G) 给编译器上 tracing GC | — | 否决,违背 Ring no-GC/Perceus 立身之本 |\n\n我强烈推荐 **(R)**:它直接修原始 UAF 的根(dup-on-share + dup/drop 对称),让 Type 回到 clone-all-escape 模型里正确参与 RC。**intern(A2)可作为 O(1) 类型相等的优化保留或撤掉,但不再是内存机制**;**A1 never-drop 会被撤销**(Type 重新可 drop)。\n\n> 关键辨析:决策表当年记的\"补 fields 遍历→爆栈\"是指**结构化 substitute fields**(深重写),**不是 dup-on-share**(RC +1)。两者不同——dup 是引用计数,不是深拷/深遍历。R 要做的是后者。当年 B-098 clone-all-escape 没能正确处理 Type-DAG 共享才退到 never-drop;R 就是把这块补对。\n\n## 我建议的规划路径\n\n这是个需要先吃透再动的重设计。我想先派一个**深度设计调研(只读)**摸清:\n1. runtime `ring_dup`/`ring_drop`/`drop_T` 对 Type-DAG 的确切行为 + A1 never-drop 当前怎么 hook 的\n2. perceus 对 Type-typed 值现在怎么处理(A1 让它不发 Clone/Drop)——撤销要动哪\n3. **所有共享 Type 子结构而不 dup 的点**(apply_subst 的 fields/variants 透传是已知一处,穷举其余)\n4. 当年 B-098 clone-all-escape 在 Type-DAG 上**具体怎么失败的**(history + 代码),确认 R 能正确处理而非重蹈\n5. 与 intern(A2)的关系:R 之上 intern 还要不要、怎么共存\n\n调研结论 → 出一份完整 spec(backlog + design.md §7.11 改写)→ 再实现 → native 实测回收效果。\n\n**确认走 (R) 这个方向吗?** 确认我就开深度设计调研。这次不赶,摸清了再动手。","type":"text"}],"diagnostics":null,"id":"msg_013Q5dNKSD7kxPrQx5ai7aQ9","model":"claude-opus-4-8","role":"assistant","stop_details":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":32,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"cache_creation_input_tokens":32,"cache_read_input_tokens":344242,"inference_geo":"not_available","input_tokens":2,"iterations":[{"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":32,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"cache_creation_input_tokens":32,"cache_read_input_tokens":344242,"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":10538,"type":"message"}],"output_tokens":10538,"server_tool_use":{"web_fetch_requests":0,"web_search_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","speed":"standard"}},"parentUuid":"480dfd84-a820-48a4-a1cf-5159ebe843c9","requestId":"req_011Cbodepvh5Lqmu4WRR2k9t","sessionId":"3e1b6baa-1cbb-4f09-aacc-0159edae5274","timestamp":"2026-06-07T09:08:16.172Z","type":"assistant","userType":"external","uuid":"41f0b8c3-3e42-4e28-8f64-e31428aad0b9","version":"2.1.162"},"source":{"file":"files/versions/10/10fe50548acf9447284b1f258d33c8154afb3cb8.jsonl.gz","line":622,"origins":[{"file":"files/versions/10/10fe50548acf9447284b1f258d33c8154afb3cb8.jsonl.gz","id":"10fe50548acf9447284b1f258d33c8154afb3cb8","paths":["__unattached_tree__/10d6d633b9efa27899edd453b01308d038ffbb50/sessions/f--Code-Ring-lang/3e1b6baa-1cbb-4f09-aacc-0159edae5274.jsonl","__unattached_tree__/15f24dbe70d2324d137808a838aa16943999db9a/sessions/f--Code-Ring-lang/3e1b6baa-1cbb-4f09-aacc-0159edae5274.jsonl","__unattached_tree__/47746b990ac710b38cf0b311b71202ec6a5d7639/sessions/f--Code-Ring-lang/3e1b6baa-1cbb-4f09-aacc-0159edae5274.jsonl","__unattached_tree__/53abc72ed27fae8d323b18954ba8e11ba7d3c85e/sessions/f--Code-Ring-lang/3e1b6baa-1cbb-4f09-aacc-0159edae5274.jsonl","__unattached_tree__/5573ec58d4ee0881f80d41a23730cb8925112863/sessions/f--Code-Ring-lang/3e1b6baa-1cbb-4f09-aacc-0159edae5274.jsonl","__unattached_tree__/8ac52072ca3a5f449b263553847fc8